  mt="THE LEON LEVY DEAD SEA SCROLLS DIGITAL LIBRARY ON THE OVERVIEW — THE IAA, THE SPECTRAL IMAGES, THE PAM NEGATIVES, HELD; 'IN PARTNERSHIP WITH GOOGLE' FOR THE FUNDS THE LIBRARY NAMES; THE SCROLLS' DATES, BEFORE 70, AND THE OLDEST BIBLICAL COPIES ABSENT",
