  d="EARLY CHRISTIAN WRITINGS, BY NAME, ON GOOGLE'S AI OVERVIEW, SIGNED OUT, 2026-10-31: 'Early Christian Writings: The Apostolic Fathers is a collection of late first- and second-century letters and theological treatises translated by Maxwell Staniforth and revised by Andrew Louth.' Publisher (Penguin Classics), length, date of the revised edition (1 September 1987), price ('Around $17.00 (Paperback) or $10.99 (eBook/Kindle)'), contents (1 Clement, Ignatius, Polycarp, Barnabas, the Didache) and a theme. No card rail; 'Amazon.com +3' inline. The paste alone of the ten has no 'AI Mode Conversation' header and no 'You said' line.",
