  d="AI AND FAITH, BY NAME, ON GOOGLE'S AI OVERVIEW, SIGNED OUT, 2026-10-31: 'The intersection of artificial intelligence and faith spans ethics, spiritual authority, and technological governance.' Three sections: the trust shift (Barna Group's figures), tech companies turning to faith for ethics (moral alignment initiatives, the Consortium for Evaluating Faith and Ethics in AI, Noreen Herzfeld), and collaborative frameworks, where the organisation is one bullet: 'A global nonprofit network of faith leaders, technologists, ethicists, and scholars'. Nine cards: the organisation's home page, LinkedIn, Harvard, Barna, BYU News, Axios, three videos. Supplied as an attached file.",
